    "title": "Football Opens 2026 Season at California Saturday Night - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago LOS ANGELES – The UCLA football team opens its 2026 season under new head coach Bob Chesney against longtime rival California at Memorial Stadium in Berkeley on Saturday, Sept. 5, at 7:30 p.m. The game will be televised on ESPN. The Bruins (0-0) and Golden Bears (0-0) will meet for the 95th time and for the first time since 2023. Read full article",
